000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID. TREQINTF.
000400 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000500 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
000600 SOURCE-COMPUTER.   AS400.
000700 OBJECT-COMPUTER.   AS400.
      **************************************************************
      *C 06/10/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C   EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C   RECOMPILE PROGRAM TO PICK UP NEW FILE FORMATS.
      **************************************************************
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT WO-PARTS-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLMM1201
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                   WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS WPFD-STATUS.
000800 DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  WO-PARTS-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           DATA RECORD IS WPFDREC.
       01  WPFDREC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM1201.
000900 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
001000 77  UPDATE-SW                    PIC 9.
001100 01  DBPARAMETERS.        COPY DBPARMS  IN COPYLIB.
002000 01  WO-PARTS-DATA.       COPY DWOPARTS IN COPYLIB.
       01  WPFD-STATUS                  PIC XX.
002100 LINKAGE SECTION.
002200 01  BASE-MMISA                   PIC X(24).
002300 COPY TREQINTF IN COPYLIB.
003100                          COPY DBSTAT  IN COPYLIB.
003200 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BASE-MMISA, MMIS-REQ-STATUS-PARMS,
                            STATUS-AREA.
003300 START-PGM.
003400     PERFORM 1-HSK.
003500     PERFORM 6-MAIN THRU 6-MAIN-EXIT.
003600 2-EOJ.
           CLOSE WO-PARTS-FILE.
003800     GOBACK.
003900 1-HSK.
           OPEN I-O WO-PARTS-FILE.
005000     MOVE "OK" TO MMIS-ERR-STATUS.
005500     MOVE 0 TO UPDATE-SW.
005600     MOVE LOW-VALUES TO STATUS-AREA.
005800 6-MAIN.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE MMIS-WO-NO TO WONUM OF WPFDREC.
005900     START WO-PARTS-FILE KEY IS = EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
006000         INVALID KEY    MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
           IF WPFD-STATUS NOT = "00" MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
006100     IF COND-WORD = 17
006200         MOVE "WO" TO MMIS-ERR-STATUS
006300         GO TO 6-MAIN-EXIT.
006400 6-MAIN-CONT.
006500     READ WO-PARTS-FILE NEXT INTO WO-PARTS-DATA
006600         AT END    MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
           IF PRT-WO-NU NOT = MMIS-WO-NO MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
           IF WPFD-STATUS NOT = "00" MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
006700     IF COND-WORD = 15
006800         MOVE "PT" TO MMIS-ERR-STATUS
006900         GO TO 6-MAIN-EXIT.
007000     IF MMIS-CORP-CODE NOT = SPACES
007100         IF MMIS-CORP-CODE = PRT-NUM
007200             NEXT SENTENCE
007300         ELSE
007400         GO TO 6-MAIN-CONT
007500     ELSE
007600     IF MMIS-WO-ITM-NO = PRT-ITEM-NO
007700         NEXT SENTENCE
007800     ELSE
007900     GO TO 6-MAIN-CONT.
008000     IF MMIS-REQ-STATUS = "RS" OR "UR"
008100         PERFORM 60-RSV-UNRSV-ITEM
008200         GO TO 6-MAIN-EXIT.
008300     IF MMIS-REQ-STATUS = "CA"
008400         MOVE 1 TO UPDATE-SW
008500         MOVE SPACES TO MMIS-REQ-NO MMIS-PO-NUM
008600         MOVE "CANCEL" TO PRT-REQ-NO.
008700     IF MMIS-REQ-STATUS = "HD" OR "IP" GO TO 6-MAIN-EXIT.
008800     IF MMIS-REQ-NO = SPACES
008900         NEXT SENTENCE
009000     ELSE
009100     MOVE 1 TO UPDATE-SW
009200     MOVE MMIS-REQ-NO TO PRT-REQ-NO.
009300     IF MMIS-PO-NUM = SPACES
009400         NEXT SENTENCE
009500     ELSE
009600     MOVE 1 TO UPDATE-SW
009700     MOVE MMIS-PO-NUM TO PRT-PO-NO.
009800     IF UPDATE-SW = 1
               NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
           GO TO 6-MAIN-EXIT.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
010000     REWRITE WPFDREC FROM WO-PARTS-DATA
               INVALID KEY    MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
           IF WPFD-STATUS NOT = "00" MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
           IF COND-WORD = 17
               MOVE "PT" TO MMIS-ERR-STATUS.
010100 6-MAIN-EXIT.    EXIT.
010200 60-RSV-UNRSV-ITEM.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
010300     DELETE WO-PARTS-FILE RECORD
               INVALID KEY    MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
           IF WPFD-STATUS NOT = "00" MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
           IF COND-WORD = 17
               MOVE "PT" TO MMIS-ERR-STATUS
               GO TO 2-EOJ.
010400     IF MMIS-REQ-STATUS = "RS"
010500         MOVE "R" TO PRT-STATUS-1
010600     ELSE
010700     MOVE "S" TO PRT-STATUS-1.
010800     MOVE SPACES TO PRT-REQ-NO.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           WRITE WPFDREC FROM WO-PARTS-DATA
               INVALID KEY    MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
           IF WPFD-STATUS NOT = "00" MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
011100     IF COND-WORD = 17
011200         MOVE "PT" TO MMIS-ERR-STATUS.
